rmance gap between frontier AI models from US tech companies and the best open-weights models from Chinese companies has closed to just 4.4 months,", "published_at": "2026-09-15T12:00:41Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-16T10:12:14Z", "body": "bodies/feed-3c126044b676.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-40e0e1fd06ff", "title": "我和我的 AI 手机吃了 3 顿饭", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "刘学文", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1679951?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/QC-T.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "爱范儿", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n米其林三星餐厅潮上潮有一个特别的就餐模式「潮 1/2」：在餐厅后厨旁边放一张小餐桌，供少数人就餐，饭菜在主厨做好的瞬间即可上桌，最大程度地减少传菜过程中的风味和热量损耗，呈现出最好的味道。\n\n\n对于讲究「一热顶三鲜」的中国人来说，这个就餐模式自有亲切感。\n\n\n理解了这个，就可以理解高通推出的高带宽计算技术（High", "published_at": "2026-09-16T04:04:48Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-16T10:12:14Z", "body": "bodies/feed-40e0e1fd06ff.json", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-41231ce9339b", "title": "OpenAI、Anthropic、谷歌联手研究 AI 安全；微信员工辟谣 AI 助手小微「偷隐私」；美国已在太空部署武器", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/370375", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/3c/59/3c59b7cfce167a72c033a3331aec9abf.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "极客公园", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n因加大 AI 投入 报道称字节跳动 2026 上半年净利润下降\n\n\n据报道，由于加大了在人工智能领域的投资，字节跳动 2026 年上半年净利润同比出现下降。同时，受 TikTok 等海外业务推动，字节跳动上半年营收同比增长", "published_at": "2026-09-16T00:22:40Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-16T10:12:14Z", "body": "bodies/feed-41231ce9339b.json", "engagement": 180, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-62d883f136ef", "title": "The 2nd China (Mianyang) Scienc