n", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-834d061a32b0", "title": "Xhaka promises ‘fire’ from Sunderland on long-awaited return to Europe", "source": "Guardian Football", "author": "Louise Taylor", "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/football/2026/sep/16/xhaka-sunderland-european-riches-alkmaar", "image_url": "https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/c7e044f8b2a1845782fd211023fc386d8e10a97e/0_145_1733_1386/master/1733.jpg?width=1200&height=630&quality=85&auto=format&fit=crop&precrop=40:21,offset-x50,offset-y0&overlay-align=bottom%2Cleft&overlay-width=100p&overlay-base64=L2ltZy9zdGF0aWMvb3ZlcmxheXMvdGctZGVmYXVsdC5wbmc&enable=upscale&s=30a6dd87794c25154fbe3f767c098e10", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Sports", "topic": "soccer", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Guardian Football", "Sports", "en", "soccer", "text", "投资"], "excerpt": "When Sunderland last played European football, club directors viewed it as a useful means of raising the cash necessary to fund floodlight upgrades at Roker", "published_at": "2026-09-16T07:00:13Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-16T10:12:14Z", "body": "bodies/feed-834d061a32b0.json", "engagement": 110, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-a1f4dfaba6e1", "title": "This Restaurant Rocks (No, Literally)", "source": "Eater", "author": "", "url": "https://www.eater.com/food-culture/986070/new-york-city-restaurants-rock-boulder-trend-pizza-4ps", "image_url": "https://platform.eater.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Rocks_B.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0,0,100,100", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Lifestyle", "topic": "food", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Eater", "Lifestyle", "en", "food", "text", "旅行探店"], "excerpt": "At some NYC restaurants, large rocks have become statement design pieces | Rhythm Zero\n\nA version of this post originally appeared in Eater Today, which", "published_at": "2026-09-16T10:10:16Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-16T10:12:14Z", "body": "bodies/feed-a1f4dfaba6e1.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-ae6065341f76", "title": "日本8月出口增19.3%，但高油价推高贸易逆差", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3781867", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/af711142-8a92-4227-8460-f97449b07371.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "旅行探店"], "excerpt": "日本8月出口延续两位数增长，对美、对华出货增速均跑赢整体，但进口成本在油价与日元弱势作用下加速攀升，贸易逆差扩大至1.1万亿日元，连续第四个月录得赤字。半导体出口的强劲动能正与能源进口的价格冲击形成对冲。\n\n\n日本财务省周三公布的数据显示，8月出口同比增长19.3%，为连续第12个月增长，但较7月的23.2%有所放缓，", "published_at": "2026-09-16T06:27:07Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-16T10:12:14Z", "body": "bodies/feed-ae6065341f76.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-b6d00c659de7", "title": "Token 之后，谁来组织 AI 计算？Arm 寻找下一代计算的答案", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/370453", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/ee/dc/eedce1a4ec4341fe9d311923ac319209.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "极客公园", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n如果说今年 3 月，Arm 推出首款自研 CPU 芯片，是这家公司向市场释放的一个信号，它开始尝试突破过去「只提供底层架构授权」的角色边界。那么在上海举办的 Arm Everywhere China 活动上，Arm 想传递的信息更加明确，不要再用过去「CPU IP 供应商」的方式理解今天的", "published_at": "2026-09-16T08:34:03Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-16T10:12:14Z", "body": "bodies/feed-b6d00c659de7.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-b6f33d7a669c", "title": "腾讯、字节、阿里「会战」AI 办公之后：Agent 领域格局已变", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/370431", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/7f/7c