, "excerpt": "一个塞在耳朵里的小东西，卖到十万一副，丢失甚至需要动用全城搜索？\n\n\n助听器，是一门奇特的生意。\n\n\n整个全球市场，近九成的助听器市场份额被五家外资公司把持：索诺瓦（峰力）、Demant（奥迪康）、WS", "published_at": "2026-09-16T08:06:55Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-16T10:12:14Z", "body": "bodies/feed-c5ba097894f0.json", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-e3118d4f98f1", "title": "Tim Willits doesn't think Rideshare's generative AI is damaging Saber's reputation", "source": "Rock Paper Shotgun", "author": "Julian Benson", "url": "https://www.rockpapershotgun.com/tim-willits-doesnt-think-rideshares-generative-ai-is-damaging-sabers-reputation", "image_url": "https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/rideshare-stimulator_SBvvZcB.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Entertainment", "topic": "gaming", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Entertainment", "Rock Paper Shotgun", "en", "gaming", "text", "科技"], "excerpt": "A few weeks ago, when I spoke with Tim Willits, chief creative officer at Saber Interactive, makers of games like Space Marine 2, SnowRunner, and World War Z,", "published_at": "2026-09-15T16:00:00Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-16T10:12:14Z", "body": "bodies/feed-e3118d4f98f1.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-e5c7211395d6", "title": "不要和盈利周期对抗！美股今年破8000点？", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3781870", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/85785ef3-5ae9-4d35-a30f-40e6e7977e2b.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资"], "excerpt": "华尔街可能严重低估了当前盈利周期的爆发力。\n\n\n据追风交易台消息，杰富瑞（Jefferies）在9月14日的最新研报中发出明确警告：不要与盈利周期对抗。在AI投资狂潮和企业盈利超预期上行的双重引擎驱动下，标普500指数预计将在今年（2026年）底飙升至8000点，并在2027年进一步触及9000点。\n\n\n报告认为，尽管", "published_at": "2026-09-16T06:16:47Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-16T10:12:14Z", "body": "bodies/feed-e5c7211395d6.json", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-f21ad67e3aa8", "title": "Japan’s Complex Stake in Freedom of Transit: Tough Calculus Behind Tokyo’s Stance on the Strait of Hormuz", "source": "Nippon.com", "author": "", "url": "https://www.nippon.com/en/in-depth/d01256/", "image_url": "https://www.nippon.com/en/ncommon/contents/in-depth/3073044/3073044.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Lifestyle", "topic": "travel", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Lifestyle", "Nippon.com", "en", "text", "travel", "旅行探店"], "excerpt": "With Iran disrupting vital oil shipments through the Strait of Hormuz, the Japanese government has for the first time taken a clear position in support of the", "published_at": "2026-09-15T21:00:13Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-16T10:12:14Z", "body": "bodies/feed-f21ad67e3aa8.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-f3fa7abfb47c", "title": "Become A God-Slaying Magical Girl In The ‘We Have Roguelite Nier Automata At Home’ Anime Action-RPG Coming To Game Pass", "source": "Kotaku", "author": "Ethan Gach", "url": "https://kotaku.com/become-a-god-slaying-magical-girl-in-the-we-have-roguelite-nier-automata-at-home-anime-action-rpg-coming-to-game-pass-2000734653", "image_url": "https://kotaku.com/app/uploads/2026/09/Kernel-Hearts-1280x720.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Entertainment", "topic": "gaming", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Entertainment", "Kotaku", "en", "gaming", "text", "游戏"], "excerpt": "The second wave of Xbox Game Pass additions for September 2026 has been revealed, and there aren’t many surprises. Looking beyond Minecraft Dungeons 2 and", "published_at": "2026-09-15T17:00:27Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-16T10:12:14Z", "body": "bodies/feed-f3fa7abfb47c.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-00e5c0464247", "title": "「AI Native 」不是魔法，「创业者」这三个字依旧厚重", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/369955", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/8d/4b/8d4b7696e8cd4896b3d4bbc46db8853e.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "极客公园", "科技"], "excerpt": "上个月，我集中跑了一趟上海和深圳，也跟几位在 AI 前沿一线折腾的创业者深聊了几次。\n\n\n齐俊元的新产品干了半年，我问他这阶段最大的收获是什么，他说了句挺朴素的话：「真的伸手去干的时候，你会发现认真还是挺重要的。」\n\n\n这话听着很普通，事后却让我不断想起，放到当下的行业环境下看，也挺让人警醒的。\n\n\n3", "published_at": "2026-09-07T09:29:26Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-00e5c0464247.json", "engagement": 150, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-0c98ad44e4c0", "title": "Ukraine's postal workers deliver lifeline under Russian fire", "source": "BBC", "author": "", "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c33kmred368o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image_url": "https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/240/cpsprodpb/42e8/live/a46209c0-b040-11f1-bb36-29bb24d8b9b8.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "News", "topic": "news", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["BBC", "News", "en", "news", "text", "投资"], "excerpt": "Every morning Igor Smelyansky looks at a vast map of Ukraine on his office wall and decides where he should put his people in harm's way.\n\nHis aides provide", "published_at": "2026-09-15T05:01:46Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-0c98ad44e4c0.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-1313881bf7d7", "title": "在学会数学之前，AI 先学会了大厂的虚荣心", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "Selina", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1680046?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/lark2pad-1789382611835-1.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "爱范儿", "科技"], "excerpt": "大概是今年以来，AI 冲击各种数学猜想，越来越像永不结局的连续剧。这个模型又拿到了更高分，那个模型又解开了一道多年无人攻克的难题，人类的数学智慧岌岌可危。\n\n\n连数学家们都坐不住了，上周末25 位菲尔兹奖得主联名上书。他们没有说 AI", "published_at": "2026-09-14T13:05:26Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-1313881bf7d7.json", "engagement": 150, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-14fa1cedef11", "title": "The Steam Frame launches during one of the slowest periods for VR on Steam, but Valve hopes to 'rekindle the excitement' for PCVR", "source": "PC Gamer", "author": "Jacob Ridley", "url": "https://www.pcgamer.com/hardware/vr-hardware/the-steam-frame-launches-during-one-of-the-slowest-periods-for-vr-on-steam-but-valve-hopes-to-rekindle-the-excitement-for-pcvr/", "image_url": "https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/fVhNmrAZuhvXZsmn7eT5NT-1280-80.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Entertainment", "topic": "gaming", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Entertainment", "PC Gamer", "en", "gaming", "text", "游戏"], "excerpt": "\nThere was a time when VR was pretty much exclusive to the PC. I'm talking about when the HTC Vive and Oculus Rift were the pinnacle of technology, circa 2016.", "published_at": "2026-09-14T19:00:00Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-14fa1cedef11.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-1b2467859b68", "title": "Valve working on Steam Frame strap that adds Index-like speakers and hot-swappable batteries, 'coming soon'", "source": "PC Gamer", "author": "Jacob Ridley", "url": "https://www.pcgamer.com/hardware/vr-hardware/valve-working-on-steam-frame-strap-that-adds-index-like-speakers-and-hot-swappable-batteries-coming-soon/", "image_url": "https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/KVTkMpFKCfeBFr47ANHtzM-1280-80.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Entertainment", "topic": "gaming", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Entertainment", "PC Gamer", "en", "gaming", "text", "游戏"], "excerpt": "\nThe Valve Index might be outdated in many ways today, but it still holds a special place in my heart for its excellent audio solution: twin speakers that", "published_at": "2026-09-14T17:10:00Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-1b2467859b68.json", "engagement": 110, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-237c59530e5a", "title": "众测招募｜泡泡骚 Low Pro：给新 iPhone 添一件极简「背心」", "source": "少数派", "author": "听歌的水獭", "url": "https://sspai.com/post/114410", "image_url": "https://rssfile.sspai.com/2026/09/10/56224b2289025e93a4db83f6aa1eb15d.png?imageMogr2/auto-orient/format/webp/ignore-error/1", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "少数派", "科技"], "excerpt": "每年九月都是苹果用户最期待的时节——苹果发布新一代 iPhone。当新机到手，你可能也要随之给手上的配件更新换代。巧了，这一次，少数派给大家带来了一款颠覆以往所有磁吸支架形态的产品，它够薄、够轻、够好用，又能完美融入你的日常审美。\n\n它就是 PopSockets 泡泡骚 Low Pro 极薄站立支架。\n\n泡泡骚创立于", "published_at": "2026-09-14T03:00:00Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-237c59530e5a.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-25106f41c026", "title": "关掉“古法研究型”后，他用AI Agent做了一家“AI时代对冲基金”", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "AI原生Lab", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3781773", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/80be0640-45e1-4165-ac62-067ef8471b59.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资"], "excerpt": "\n“Houston，把Desmond周末跑出来的策略图调出来。”\n\n\nBrian", "published_at": "2026-09-15T03:16:09Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-25106f41c026.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-2d7eaf7e10a2", "title": "传玛莎拉蒂和华为+江淮合作开发电动车；苹果最大新品阵容时代开启；人人影视回归，终身 VIP 888 元", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/369871", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/41/f6/41f6c917e8114c701cd73ec82e0efc49.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "极客公园", "科技"], "excerpt": "\nOpenAI 智能体被曝「接管」德国维基网站\n\n\n一项最新曝光的人工智能安全事件正在引发业内广泛关注。\n\n\n根据研究人员披露的信息，今年春季，一批与 OpenAI 模型相关的自主智能体曾在未经授权的情况下「接管」一家德国维基网站，并将其改造成供其他 AI 系统交流信息的公共平台。这一事件此前从未对外公开，而", "published_at": "2026-09-05T00:24:15Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-2d7eaf7e10a2.json", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-3a99e43d6d02", "title": "iOS 27 正式版体验：Siri AI 终于开窍了，老 iPhone 升级也有新东西", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "郑廷旭", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1680134?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/img_6aa8cd9239571.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "爱范儿", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n从 6 月 WWDC 首次亮相，到历经 3 个多月、多轮开发者预览版与公测版的调试打磨，今天凌晨，苹果终于面向所有用户正式推送了 iOS 27 正式版。\n\n只要你的设备在支持列表内（最低依然支持到 iPhone 11 系列与 iPhone SE 2），现在打开「设置 – 通用 –", "published_at": "2026-09-15T05:00:50Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-3a99e43d6d02.json", "engagement": 150, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-3ed03b69f347", "title": "The Public Theater’s New Restaurant Pays Homage to Old New York", "source": "Eater NY", "author": "", "url": "https://ny